From 9f49c4ab7622f5704d7a434f3935091016e3afa6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Petr Sumbera <sumbera@volny.cz>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 10:25:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add Solaris event ports selector

Use Solaris event ports as the native os-poll backend instead of the poll(2)-based fallback. Keep the existing poll backend available behind mio_unsupported_force_poll_poll for comparison and unsupported builds.

Based on upstream tokio-rs/mio PR #1962 commits 729b013, fced4be, and 810b4e4, refreshed against the mio 1.2.0 crate version locked by Codex.
